, "memory_paths": {"auto": "/tmp/mte-ng-rebase-3qkwuuky/claude-config/projects/-tmp-mte-ng-rebase-3qkwuuky-ledgerline/memory/"}, "messaging_socket_path": "/tmp/cc-socks/27207.sock", "fast_mode_state": "off", "fast_mode_disabled_reason": "sdk_opt_in_required", "per_turn_effort_active": true, "view_mode": "default"}
{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "id": "msg_011CfcTLiGWqd4RES3u4KQLs", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "`git rebase --onto <newbase> <upstream> [<branch>]` replays the commits that are in `<branch>` but not in `<upstream>` on top of `<newbase>`. A plain `git rebase` forces the new base and the cut-off point to be the same thing. `--onto` separates them, so you can move a slice of history somewhere else.\n\n**Example: moving a branch off another feature branch**\n\nSay `feature-b` was branched from `feature-a`, but you want it based on `main` instead:\n\n```\nmain:       A---B\n                 \\\nfeature-a:        C---D\n                       \\\nfeature-b:              E---F\n```\n\nRun:\n\n```\ngit rebase --onto main feature-a feature-b\n```\n\nThis takes the commits in `feature-b` that aren't in `feature-a` (E and F) and replays them onto `main`:\n\n```\nmain:       A---B---E'---F'     (feature-b)\n                 \\\nfeature-a:        C---D\n```\n\nE' and F' are new commits with the same changes but new hashes.\n\n**Other common uses**\n\n- **Drop a range of commits.** `git rebase --onto HEAD~4 HEAD~2` removes the two commits just below the tip, which are the commits after `HEAD~4` up to `HEAD~2`. The commits above them are replayed onto `HEAD~4`.\n- **Transplant after the parent was squash-merged.** If `feature-a` was squash-merged into `main`, run `git rebase --onto main feature-a feature-b` to bring over only `feature-b`'s own commits, without re-applying `feature-a`'s old ones.\n\n**Summary:** `--onto X A B` means \"take commits in `A..B` and put them on top of X.\""}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 7616, "cache_read_input_tokens": 16975, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 7616}, "output_tokens": 8, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "not_available"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "9e481c90-f19a-45d6-a483-8ed588466e5f", "uuid": "a41e9fa6-6b1a-436f-8b18-c1e5b61d18b4", "timestamp": "2026-10-02T00:21:42.075Z", "request_id": "req_011CfcTLhzA3KeQT22DYEzK9"}
